-**Parameters and Typical Values:**
-*   $w, h$: Image resolution.
-*   $b$: Number of exterior faces. Depends on grid complexity.
-*   $a$: Projected area of external faces in pixels. Proportional to the number of pixels covered by exterior faces [S1].
